{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1095943-evidence-of-bale-hounds-activity","id":1095943,"title":"Evidence of Bale Hounds activity","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-23T09:29:05-07:00","id":1095943,"title":"Evidence of Bale Hounds activity","content":"So I want my players to find traces and evidence in area of Bale Hounds activities. BESIDE Wounds \u2013 idea is that local Bale Hounds wants to defile great Locus ( or already did this but mask it with Rite ) and so this evidence is off the list. How would you mark in subtler way that Maeljin Servants are working in nearby?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T09:33:53-07:00","id":1095944,"title":"","content":"I've always liked just a gut feeling that something bad was in the area, like a spiritual radiation is present. Maybe parts of the shadow are seared a little or the outline of a spirit is burnt into a wall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"BurritoMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13009_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"585"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T12:07:40-07:00","id":1095989,"title":"","content":"More negative spirits, other packs starting to develop tension internally, Lunes going raggedy...<br /> <br /> Take what signs you would expect a spy to leave behind and apply the werewolf lens to it.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Doesn't Blasphemies start off with a list of targets that gives you places to showcase wonkiness and that someone is up to something?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 05-23-2017, 03:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T15:03:46-07:00","id":1096039,"title":"","content":"Spiritually speaking, don't display open wounds... yet. Just bruises. Not ruin, but decadence. Make it obvious it's beyond the ken of those affected, even if there's a third party involved. Example: A sudden burst in substance abuse - not enough to be say, deadly or irreversibly traumatic, but enough to worry people. (The person won't OD yet, but they can't function without their fix.) Build the tension and then have it burst like a bloated corpse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby"